WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.177
Every photo on your phone has a story you never told.

2
00:00:05.277 --> 00:00:08.853
Tap plus, then Talk over a photo.

3
00:00:10.353 --> 00:00:15.338
It reads the day the photo was taken, so your story lands on that day.

4
00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:21.740
Then just talk. However long you talk is how long it lasts.

5
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.796
Have a listen, and keep it.

6
00:00:27.296 --> 00:00:30.390
Now that day in your journal has your voice in it.
